   "lines": [
    "I spent the morning",
    "walking through the",
    "woods with Dick, his",
    "sister Miss Rose, and",
    "their cousin, Miss",
    "Alice Lee - a very",
    "sweet pretty girl.",
    "About midday we",
    "drove over to the",
    "Whitneys where we",
    "took dinner and tea.",
    "We spent the evening",
    "dancing and sing-",
    "ing, driving back",
    "about 11 oclock."
   ],
